    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνανήχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνανέω</span>
			, <i>swim,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Resp.</u>
				475b1
			</span></i> (s. v.l.); <i>rise to the surface,</i> Plu <i><span class="en">
				2.985b
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>revive, recover,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				8.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐκ κλύδωνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.260
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ νόσου λοιμώδους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					7.17.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>swim up-stream,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.120
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			 form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνανήξας: διαπλεύσας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήξεις: κολυμβήσεις</span>
			(fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀννήξεις: ἀνακ.</span>),
		Id.</div>
